<br/>
Usage when (player name)<br/><br/>
<br/>
Shows when a player last logged on, for example:<br/><br/>
<pre>
when gandalf
Gandalf last logged on 3 days, 4 hours ago (Sat 10 Oct 2026 01:43).
</pre>
If the player is in the game right now, you are told so instead.<br/>
You can ask about a player who is not in the game once every 5 seconds.<br/>
Times are the server's time.<br/>
<br/><br/>
<br/>See Also:<br/><br/>
Who<br/><br/>
